FUTURE OPTIONAL VMS
================================================================================

Additional VMs are NOT part of the initial environment.

They are introduced only when they solve a real
learning or architectural problem.


Possible future machines:


    FILE01
        dedicated Windows file server


    MON01
        monitoring server


    VPN01
        VPN / routing / firewall appliance


    LNX01
