    WIN02
        second Windows client


    DC02
        secondary Domain Controller


IMPORTANT:

Do NOT create these VMs at the beginning merely for complexity.

A VM is introduced only when:

    architecture requires it
        OR
    a learning scenario requires it
        OR
    troubleshooting requires it


Otherwise it remains in TODO.


