================================================================================
TODO / FUTURE IMPLEMENTATIONS
================================================================================

The project uses a central TODO list for features
that are intentionally NOT implemented immediately.


The TODO list is an active extension layer of the project.

It contains infrastructure and services that may be introduced
after the core architecture is complete.


The TODO list should contain:


    FEATURE
        ↓
    WHY IT MAY BE NEEDED
        ↓
    PREREQUISITES
        ↓
    FUTURE STAGE
        ↓
    TUTORIAL / IMPLEMENTATION
        ↓
    STATUS


Examples:


NETWORKING
----------

    VPN
    Firewall Appliance
    Network Segmentation
    Multiple Subnets
    Advanced Routing
    NAT
    Advanced libvirt networking


WINDOWS
-------

    FILE01
    DFS
    Advanced GPO
    Windows Deployment
    Additional Domain Controller
    Windows infrastructure services


ITSM
----

    Advanced workflows
    SLA
    Asset discovery
    Software deployment integration
    Advanced automation


LICENSING
---------

    License expiration workflow
    Renewal workflow
    License reassignment
    Automated license reporting


MONITORING
----------

    MON01
    Prometheus
    Grafana
    Alerting
    Centralized logs
    Loki
    OpenSearch / ELK


SECURITY
--------

    MFA
    VPN
    Network segmentation
    Advanced auditing
    Security baselines
    Access reviews


CLOUD
-----

    Additional Floci services
    Advanced IAM
    Cloud networking
    Additional Lambda workflows
    Advanced secrets management


AUTOMATION
----------

    User provisioning
    Asset synchronization
    Health checks
    ITSM automation
    Infrastructure automation


IMPORTANT:

The TODO list is NOT a dumping ground.

Every significant TODO item should eventually receive:

    reason
    prerequisites
    learning objective
    focused implementation/tutorial


The master context should contain only:

    - what the feature is
    - why it exists
    - where it belongs
    - current status


Detailed implementation belongs in:


    tutorial
    conspect
    documentation
    implementation task


This prevents the main context from becoming unnecessarily huge.


